# Optional browser-side Baidu Maps JavaScript API key.
# Copy to .env.local and configure localhost as an allowed referrer in Baidu's console.
# Do not put a secret server-side AK here: VITE_ variables are visible in the browser.
VITE_BAIDU_BROWSER_AK=
# Server AK belongs in backend BAIDU_SERVER_AK, not browser-exposed variables.
# Vite exposes only the VITE_BAIDU_BROWSER_ prefix.
